<title>USA: Auxer Indus completes acquisition.</title>
<headline>Auxer Indus completes acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>RIDGEWOOD, N.J. 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Auxer Industries Inc said Tuesday that it completed acquiring Farmingdale, N.Y.- based Harvey-Westbury Corp, a privately held company specializing in automotive after-market products.</p>
<p>Under the terms of the acquisition agreement, shareholders of Harvey-Westbury Corp will receive a total of 170,000 restricted shares of Auxer common stock.</p>
